  "term": "State–Trait Anxiety Inventory",
  "definition": "The State–Trait Anxiety Inventory is a tool used to measure anxiety. It is intended to distinguish between anxiety that is temporary in the moment and anxiety that reflects a more general, long-lasting tendency.",
